。所有输出结果都要以最明确的描述，不要带解释和说明性以及总结性的副标题文字！", 1024, true, 97853306898701, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 21, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 19, "type": "AILab_QwenVL", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "AILab_QwenVL"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [341.3272705078125, 157.65859985351562], "pos": [839.991943359375, 609.1128540039062], "widgets_values": ["这张宣传海报采用鲜艳活泼的日系卡通风格设计，整体色调明亮饱和，主视觉为红色毛绒材质背景与白色包装零食形成强烈对比。顶部横幅由蓬松红白相间毛边框构成，中央大号黄色粗体字样“会员满300-80”占据主导位置，字体圆润饱满且带有轻微立体阴影效果；其上方左侧是蓝色圆形“稿定 YOUR LOGO”标识，右侧附有萌态橙色火焰表情贴纸装饰。\n\n中间区域放置两袋食品：一包印有金色艺术字“CRISPY CRISP CHIPS”的米白色薯片袋，品牌名BICKEAJ清晰可见于下方；另一盒蓝白配色饼干礼盒标示EXQUITE SNER，图案包含星形花环及烤制饼状物插画，并标注GAODING字样。两者斜倚在仿毛绒堆叠结构上，周围点缀彩色星星、音符小图标及可爱动物造型配件（例如左下角戴眼镜黄鸭头像）。\n\n底部巨大数字“12.12”以厚实红色毛绒块拼成，边缘呈锯齿感并覆盖细密格子纹理，正中嵌入活动时间“12月6日—12月12日”，字号适中偏小但仍具辨识度。中部横向黑色标签内含“双12钜惠 | 狂欢开启”，外侧配有粉色云朵图形修饰，上下方分别设有笑脸和火苗表情符号增强趣味性。“点击修改文字”提示位于该标签旁的小黑底白字按钮式元素。\n\n整张画面光线均匀柔和无明显投影方向，营造轻松愉悦氛围；物品摆放错落有序却不显拥挤，在色彩搭配方面运用高纯度亮色为主导，辅以暖调渐变过渡区提升层次感。右下角落饰紫色礼物盒子形象角色拥有夸张眼睛特征，强化节日促销情绪表达。整个构图富有童趣互动性和商品展示引导功能，适合用于电商平台购物节推广场景。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 22, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 21, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [19], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "size": [270, 194], "pos": [2046.919189453125, 194.59628295898438], "widgets_values": ["seedvr2_ema_3b_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors", 528675807, "randomize", 1920, 5], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 18, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "block_swap_config", "label": "block_swap_config", "type": "block_swap_config", "localized_name": "block_swap_config"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "extra_args", "label": "extra_args", "type": "extra_args", "localized_name": "extra_args"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "new_resolution"}, "name": "new_resolution", "label": "new_resolution", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "new_resolution"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}], "flags": {}, "id": 17, "type": "SeedVR2", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SeedVR2"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [612.7051391601562, 625.1671752929688], "pos": [2941.772705078125, 169.3413848876953], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 19, "label": "ima